# Citation metadata for this repository.
#
# GitHub renders this as the "Cite this repository" button. The `version` here is
# kept in step with manifest.json by a test, because a citation that names the
# wrong version is worse than one that names none.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin in work you publish, please cite it as below."
title: "Modelica Studio: a visual Modelica modelling and simulation environment for Obsidian"
abstract: >-
  An Obsidian plugin for modelling, simulating and plotting Modelica systems: a
  visual drag-and-drop schematic editor whose simulations run on OpenModelica.
type: software
authors:
